## 8. Unified Analysis Pipeline Architecture

Combining all findings into a layered architecture for Music Copilot:

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    Producer Chat / AI                     │
│  (context: full project state + analysis results)        │
└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘
